    "body": "Merge-time refresh stopped, nothing was pushed. Main already names the platform command key in the same strings through command_key() (issue 1238), and it conflicts with this PR's wording in three hunks: crates/ui/src/egui_app/boundary.rs (HINTS const here vs hints() fn on main, picking line), crates/ui/src/egui_app/geo_page.rs (EDGE_HINT const and the Click selects hover text here vs edge_hint() / click_selects_hint() fns on main), crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs (doc comment on the viewport tab: here Ctrl or Cmd adds, on main Ctrl adds plus the box-pick sentence). Both sides rewrite the same hint logic differently, so a keep-both merge would be a guess. The author should merge origin/main and decide which remainder of this PR is still needed (the other files, boundary_draft.rs, structural.rs, first-run.md, merged cleanly).",
